usiness_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","review_id":"8FxjmLToJmBeifO5vPLYcQ","date":"2016-11-15T09:27:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9469807147979736,"text_excerpt":"I honestly don't know why it took me so long to try and review this place considering it's in my hood! I stopped by here during lunch time and ordered a lunch special. I'll definitely be back! Sushi Bento Box Lunch: Comes with a california roll, miso soup, house salad which was mixed greens with house made ginger dressing, few slices of orange, fried dumpling, cucumber salad, and an assortment of tuna, salmon, whitefish (probably escolar), and shrimp sushi. California Roll- Probably the most well-known roll anywhere you go. Crab stick, avocado, cucumber, topped with roe. A great place to start if you are new to sushi and don't want anything raw. I usually don't like california rolls (hate..."},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","review_id":"9QTjIaq--ww_y9_3mhZ_CQ","date":"2017-03-17T18:40:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415910243988037,"text_excerpt":"Great rolls here. I'm a veg head but I still love and appreciate sushi. Their sweet potato roll is delicious and I haven't seen anything like it anywhere else. They also have many other veg appetizer and entrée options. The ambiance is nice. They have bar seating, tables and booths so whether you come dressed up for dinner or casual lunch you'll fit right in. Staff is always friendly."},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","review_id":"e6XKF1Y1vgd5ukbNB11fcg","date":"2018-10-01T03:02:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.935196042060852,"text_excerpt":"This place is so good. I go about once a week for fresh quick good tasting sushi. Prices are good I usually stick to the small rolls just to have variety. Always my go to rolls are : spicy crunchy tuna, rock n roll, rock shrimp and avocado and the boss man. There spicy salmon roll is also amazing. Don't forget to ask for a side of spicy mayo! I would say best place on the Westbank for sushi, you'll walk in and see its pretty empty but they do a ton of take outs. Try it out. 9/10/18- update! Tried a special roll the black and gold! I recommend! It's shrimp tempura and then tops with smoked salmon and tuna! It's 11 bucks but it comes with a lot more and it's worth it! One of the best rolls ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","photo_id":"74fSG6BBmLVpIU8hwLUf_g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/74fSG6BBmLVpIU8hwLUf_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9176441431045532},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","photo_id":"4tEeRWqiMopYuJCdvjrE0g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4tEeRWqiMopYuJCdvjrE0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.889345645904541},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","photo_id":"HnuqguJTUGNmMSDPXurYmg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HnuqguJTUGNmMSDPXurYmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8879426717758179},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","photo_id":"CWLoIP_FRhqBQ6GZnO70pA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CWLoIP_FRhqBQ6GZnO70pA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377580642700195},{"business_id":"FNwvXKcoN_WZzOOKqrfFAQ","photo_id":"H9BmSE4C7kEe_pVDrHPdQQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/H9BmSE4C7kEe_pVDrHPdQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.810718297958374}]},"notebook_case":null}
